1
00:00:01,501 --> 00:00:04,471
I thought a flower
shop would sweeten up my life.

2
00:00:04,637 --> 00:00:07,007
What was I thinking?

3
00:00:07,007 --> 00:00:08,975
It's a battlefield here...

4
00:00:10,577 --> 00:00:12,879
So a married man seduced
three employees?

5
00:00:12,879 --> 00:00:15,882
He deserves all that.
What was the owner thinking?

6
00:00:16,516 --> 00:00:18,184
That was how my first shop
went to bust.

7
00:00:19,519 --> 00:00:21,654
Because of someone's stupid
romance scandal.

8
00:00:22,622 --> 00:00:24,124
I can't give up like this.

9
00:00:24,124 --> 00:00:26,693
I opened a new shop
with everything I had.

10
00:00:29,629 --> 00:00:32,665
It's an ordinary flower shop,
but there's one special thing.

11
00:00:33,833 --> 00:00:36,836
It went viral on SNS
and will soon be on TV.

12
00:00:37,504 --> 00:00:40,507
I began to think my life
would really turn around.

13
00:00:40,507 --> 00:00:42,375
Only until I screwed up again.

14
00:00:43,143 --> 00:00:44,144
I'm sorry.

15
00:00:44,711 --> 00:00:46,146
I don't understand.

16
00:00:46,746 --> 00:00:47,746
Excuse me...

17
00:00:50,583 --> 00:00:51,703
I'm going to head out first.

18
00:00:52,152 --> 00:00:54,354
I am quitting
after this month.

19
00:00:56,222 --> 00:00:58,324
Where did I go wrong?
